{"displayStem":"그림은 손목굽힘근지지띠 부근의 횡단 관계를 단순화했다. 가운데 큰 공간 X와 그 앞안쪽의 작은 공간 Y를 구분했다. X 안에는 원형 힘줄 단면 9개를 표시했고, 그 옆에 신경 하나가 있다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"독립 제작 모식도 · 크기 비례 아님","links":[]}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence batch-C01 c01-batch\"><div class=\"evidence\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 470\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"구조 관계를 단순화한 교육용 모식도\"><rect width=\"800\" height=\"470\" fill=\"white\"></rect><text x=\"80\" y=\"50\" font-size=\"28\" style=\"font-size:28px\" fill=\"#111\">가쪽(엄지 쪽)</text><text x=\"570\" y=\"50\" font-size=\"28\" style=\"font-size:28px\" fill=\"#111\">안쪽</text><path d=\"M100 180H690\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"5\" fill=\"none\"></path><path d=\"M100 180Q110 350 400 350Q680 350 690 180\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"></path><ellipse cx=\"645\" cy=\"125\" rx=\"90\" ry=\"42\" stroke=\"#111\" fill=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\"></ellipse><text x=\"637\" y=\"132\" font-size=\"28\" style=\"font-size:28px\" fill=\"#111\">Y</text><text x=\"375\" y=\"225\" font-size=\"25\" style=\"font-size:25px\" fill=\"#111\">X</text><ellipse cx=\"225\" cy=\"260\" rx=\"18\" ry=\"16\" stroke=\"#111\" fill=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\"></ellipse><ellipse cx=\"288\" cy=\"260\" rx=\"18\" ry=\"16\" stroke=\"#111\" fill=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\"></ellipse><ellipse cx=\"351\" cy=\"260\" rx=\"18\" ry=\"16\" stroke=\"#111\" fill=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\"></ellipse><ellipse cx=\"414\" cy=\"260\" rx=\"18\" ry=\"16\" stroke=\"#111\" fill=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\"></ellipse><ellipse cx=\"477\" cy=\"260\" rx=\"18\" ry=\"16\" stroke=\"#111\" fill=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\"></ellipse><ellipse cx=\"225\" cy=\"315\" rx=\"18\" ry=\"16\" stroke=\"#111\" fill=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\"></ellipse><ellipse cx=\"288\" cy=\"315\" rx=\"18\" ry=\"16\" stroke=\"#111\" fill=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\"></ellipse><ellipse cx=\"351\" cy=\"315\" rx=\"18\" ry=\"16\" stroke=\"#111\" fill=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\"></ellipse><ellipse cx=\"414\" cy=\"315\" rx=\"18\" ry=\"16\" stroke=\"#111\" fill=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\"></ellipse><ellipse cx=\"560\" cy=\"238\" rx=\"22\" ry=\"17\" stroke=\"#111\" fill=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\"></ellipse><text x=\"110\" y=\"140\" font-size=\"28\" style=\"font-size:28px\" fill=\"#111\">굽힘근지지띠</text><text x=\"80\" y=\"410\" font-size=\"28\" style=\"font-size:28px\" fill=\"#111\">단면 관계 · 뒤쪽은 아래</text></svg></div></div>"]}